144	  /// cloned.
145	  ///
146	  /// Versions >= 1.8.0 do not require 'pod setup' and default to a CDN instead
147	  /// of a locally cloned repository.
148	  /// See http://blog.cocoapods.org/CocoaPods-1.8.0-beta/
